    "title": "University of Washington Proteomics Resource",
    "excerpt":"                                                                                                                                                UWPR provides UW researchers with analytical and instructional expertise in proteomics techniques and data analysis.                                                   Read More                                                                                                                                                                               Learn more about UWPR’s state of the art LC-MS instrumentation and computational resources.                                                   Read More                                                                                                                                                                               A collection of methods, protocols, and hardware can be found here, from sample prep to column packing.                                                   Read More                                                                                                                                                                                       Information on software, utilities, and related resources available at the UWPR to analyze and visualize proteomics data.                                                   Read More                                                                                                                                                                               The UWPR supports a wide range of proteomics research. A collection of the publications is available here.                                                   Read More                                                                                                                                                                               Interested in contacting or visiting the UWPR? Find phone and email contacts, address, and shuttle information here.                                                   Read More                                                  \t             Our Mission      Proteomics is one of many complementary tools we apply to broaden our knowledge of biological systems. At UWPR we enable researchers to exploit powerful proteomic technologies to explore living systems and answer important biological questions.                   \t             University of Washington      UWPR is located at the University of Washington School of Medicine, South Lake Union (SLU) campus.           ","url": "https://proteomicsresource.washington.edu/"
